&lt;h5 class="smt_head4" style="padding-left:22.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;２　地域ごとの情報&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:31.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;(1) 売上高&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text5" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:40.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;本邦以外の外部顧客への売上高がないため、該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:31.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;(2) 有形固定資産&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text5" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:40.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;本邦以外に所在している有形固定資産がないため、該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h5 class="smt_head4" style="padding-left:22.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;３　主要な顧客ごとの情報&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:right;padding-right:172pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;(単位：千円)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="text-align:left;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="align_left" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:312pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
